<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA V INDIA FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA V INDIA FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard at the end of the first</p>
<p>test match between Sri Lanka and India on Wednesday.</p>
<p>India first innings 537-8 declared (N.Sidhu 111, S.Tendulkar</p>
<p>143, M.Azharuddin 126)</p>
<p>Sri Lanka first innings (overnight 587-1)</p>
<p> S.Jayasuriya c Ganguly b Chauhan	    340</p>
<p> M.Atapattu c Mongia b Kulkarni		 26</p>
<p> R.Mahanama lbw b Kumble			 225</p>
<p> A.de Silva c Prasad b Ganguly		 126</p>
<p> A.Ranatunga run out				86</p>
<p> M.Jayawardene c Kulkarni b Ganguly	   66</p>
<p> R.Kaluwitharana not out			  14</p>
<p> C.Vaas not out				     11</p>
<p> Extras (b-27 lb-10 w-7 nb-14)		  58</p>
<p> Total (for 6 wickets)			   952</p>
<p>Did not bat: R.Pushpakumara, M. Muralitharan, J.Silva</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-39, 2-615, 3-615, 4-790, 5-921, 6-924</p>
<p>Bowling: Prasad 24-1-88-0 (4w), Kuruvilla 14-2-74-0 (4nb),</p>
<p>Chauhan 78-8-276-1 (3w, 5nb), Kumble 72-7-223-1 (5nb), Kulkarni</p>
<p>70-10-195-1, Ganguly 9-0-53-2, Tendulkar 2-1-2-0, Dravid 2-0-4-0</p>
<p>Result: match drawn</p>
